    "sent_id": "t0032.s02",
    "start": 316.264,
    "text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of transmission mechanics?",
    "unit_id": "t0032.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5167,
    "char_start": 5054,
    "end": 326.461,
    "sent_id": "t0033.s01",
    "start": 319.557,
    "text": "Honestly, the wear and tear on the chain is the best early indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5226,
    "char_start": 5168,
    "end": 330.004,
    "sent_id": "t0033.s02",
    "start": 326.461,
    "text": "We've seen this in equipment that uses Shimano components.",
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5308,
    "char_start": 5227,
    "end": 334.953,
    "sent_id": "t0033.s03",
    "start": 330.004,
    "text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different sets of equipment.",
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5338,
    "char_start": 5309,
    "end": 336.713,
    "sent_id": "t0034.s01",
    "start": 334.953,
    "text": "Where does that stop working?",
    "unit_id": "t0034.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5491,
    "char_start": 5339,
    "end": 346.776,
    "sent_id": "t0035.s01",
    "start": 336.713,
    "text": "And when teams adopt Shimano equipment within that system, the benefits become apparent – I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5538,
    "char_start": 5492,
    "end": 349.406,
    "sent_id": "t0036.s01",
    "start": 346.776,
    "text": "What is the heuristic that you always rely on?",
    "unit_id": "t0036.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5597,
    "char_start": 5539,
    "end": 352.723,
    "sent_id": "t0036.s02",
    "start": 349.406,
    "text": "Where do maintenance and transmission mechanics intersect?",
    "unit_id": "t0036.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5679,
    "char_start": 5598,
    "end": 358.818,
    "sent_id": "t0037.s01",
    "start": 352.723,
    "text": "Frankly, the service intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
    "unit_id": "t0037.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5751,
    "char_start": 5680,
    "end": 364.16,
    "sent_id": "t0037.s02",
    "start": 358.818,
    "text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
    "unit_id": "t0037.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5825,
    "char_start": 5752,
    "end": 368.3,
    "sent_id": "t0038.s01",
    "start": 364.16,
    "text": "Before we wrap up, what's one thing that listeners can try out this week?",
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5894,
    "char_start": 5826,
    "end": 372.891,
    "sent_id": "t0039.s01",
    "start": 368.3,
    "text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5924,
    "char_start": 5895,
    "end": 374.849,
    "sent_id": "t0039.s02",
    "start": 372.891,
    "text": "Everything else is iteration.",
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5983,
    "char_start": 5925,
    "end": 378.534,
    "sent_id": "t0040.s01",
    "start": 374.849,
    "text": "Before we close, thank you again to our friends at Linear.",
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6064,
    "char_start": 5984,
    "end": 383.617,
    "sent_id": "t0040.s02",
    "start": 378.534,
    "text": "Linear is the issue tracking system designed for speed – built for the keyboard.",
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6110,
    "char_start": 6065,
    "end": 386.105,
    "sent_id": "t0040.s03",
    "start": 383.617,
    "text": "Diego Ferrer, thank you for the conversation.",
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01"
  },
  {
